🤖 My Chatbot
A friendly little Python script that talks back! I made this to learn how to turn keywords into real conversations.

💬 What it can do
Listen for words: It finds keywords like "sad" or "hello" even in long sentences.
Stay chill: It doesn't care about capital letters.
Chat back: It gives you advice, motivation, or a simple hello.

🚀 How to use it
Save the code as bot.py.
Run it in your terminal: python bot.py.
Type your message and hit Enter.
Type "bye" when you want to leave.

🛠️ The plan
I want to make it smarter by adding more words and making the responses feel more like a real person.

